    "text": "Good morning, listeners tuning in across the United States — you’re with Alex and Jordan on Audexa Radio, and it’s time for Code & Coffee. We’ve got a question every developer has probably bumped into: Are we making our software stack more complicated than it needs to be by ignoring the platform we already have?",
    "type": "intro"
